// Dialog :
"P2574090027" "There were Mu present? Sent by Scirocco? Interesting. How did he know of my base, or that it was under attack? I will need to speak with him at some length. I do not like this kind of interference in my affairs. Remember that, {VillainName}. Still, what truly upsets me is that Longbow found that base at all."
// RandomFameString :
"P906212967" "I heard {VillainName} has started working for Ghost Widow. We're doomed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1965456944" "I have spoken with Scirocco. He says that he had learned of the Longbow attack from one of his Mu Mystics, who had been working on a special project. Unfortunately, that mystic's role in that project came to light, and the heroes have captured him. Scirocco tells me that if I have you recover that man, he'll share how he learned what he knows.<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to free that mystic, {VillainName}.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3226100429" "Free the mystic"
// SendOffString :
"P3155529082" "Try to bring this man out alive, {VillainName}. He is the key to learning what Scirocco knows."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2111411328" "Rescue the mystic"

