// Dialog :
"P3391968081" "Excellent. Scirocco and I have been talking. It's provided some interesting insights. It seems that he learned of the discovery of my base because he has been trying to keep the discoverer out of his own affairs. That person is no less than Numina, the spirit mystic of the hated Freedom Phalanx! And we have drawn up a plan against her."
// RandomFameString :
"P3367696227" "I hear {VillainName} infiltrated a Longbow prison!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2403303708" "Unfortunately, the mystic was defeated. Fortunately, I was able to commune with his departed soul. Once I learned what he knew, I went to confront Scirocco. But instead of the battle I expected, he and I have been talking. It's provided some interesting insights. It seems that he learned of the discovery of my base because he has been trying to keep the discoverer out of his own affairs. That person is no less than Numina, the spirit mystic of the hated Freedom Phalanx! And we have drawn up a plan against her."
// RandomFameString :
"P3593637359" "I hear {VillainName} screwed up a rescue attempt!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1424813739" "Numina and I are alike, in a way. We are neither of us alive. But whereas I am a ghost, she's an astral form. It makes it difficult for the two of us to hurt each other. But Scirocco's research has uncovered an interesting spell that might be able to effect her. Regrettably, a few of the components are quite rare. However, the Circle of Thorns often keeps what I'll need around for similar spells of their own. And I will need you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>get those components from a Circle encampment beneath Thorn Isle in the Nerva Archipelago.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1013992261" "Secure the spell components"
// SendOffString :
"P629077883" "There should be three components you'll need to find. Once we have those, Numina will soon come to regret her interference in Arachnos business."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P792363619" "Steal spell components"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1936554008" "Until we have those spell components, Numina will remain a threat."

