// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P582031639" "We have the incantation. We have the components. The only thing we're missing for this ritual is Numina. But don't think you can just go busting into Paragon City to find her. No, she's clever, and will have to be lured into our territory, then trapped long enough to hold her to the fight. And while I have an idea of how to trap her, I need to know more about how to lure her in. And that's where my spies have come in handy. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>It turns out that the Crey Corporation recently did a study of Numina. I want you to get it for me.</A> Their more scientific perspective may give me the clue I need to draw Numina into the trap."
// AcceptString :
"P2183522761" "Set a trap for Numina"
// SendOffString :
"P94109094" "Get to the Crey facility on Grandville. There, find out everything they've learned about Numina."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P281934071" "Find info on Numina"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P301686543" "We must learn everything we can before we strike."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1365653430" "Crey collects data on all heroes, large and small. No doubt they'll have files on Numina."

